cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "A11yJourney: accessibility checks for native Android apps"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free command-line tool that captures screens from Android
  devices and reports accessibility barriers (missing and meaningless labels,
  focus order, text and icon contrast, text resize at 200%, and touch target
  size), each mapped to a WCAG success criterion and judged against a
  conformance profile, with text, JSON, and SARIF output.
type: software
authors:
